{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13425","headline":"晚秋集贤院即事寄徐薛二侍郎 · 常衮","name":"晚秋集贤院即事寄徐薛二侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穆穆上清居，沈沈中秘书。\n金铺深内殿，石甃净寒渠。\n花树台斜倚，空烟阁半虚。\n缥囊披锦绣，翠轴卷琼琚。\n墨润冰文茧，香销蠹字鱼。\n翻黄桐叶老，吐白桂花初。\n旧德双游处，聊芳十载余。\n北朝荣庾薛，西汉盛严徐。\n侍讲亲华扆，徴吟步绮疏。\n缀帘金翡翠，赐砚玉蟾蜍。\n序秩东南远，离忧岁月除。\n承明期重入，江海意何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}